ur 24\/7 operations center avoffice@www.kerojetservices.com online portal, or by contacting our local agents at the airport. Furthermore, contact details are provided on the contact page.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ct-accordion-item \">\r\n                    <div class=\"ct-ac-title \" data-target=\"#1f6323bct_accordion-6646056\">\r\n                        <a class=\"ct-ac-title-text\">What types of fuel do you provide?                            <i class=\"ct-accordion-icon-plus\"><\/i>\r\n                        <\/a>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div id=\"1f6323bct_accordion-6646056\" class=\"ct-ac-content\">We provide Jet A-1 compliant with international aviation standards.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ct-accordion-item \">\r\n                    <div class=\"ct-ac-title \" data-target=\"#91ed6f7ct_accordion-6646056\">\r\n                        <a class=\"ct-ac-title-text\">Are your fueling operations certified?                            <i class=\"ct-accordion-icon-plus\"><\/i>\r\n                        <\/a>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div id=\"91ed6f7ct_accordion-6646056\" class=\"ct-ac-content\">Yes, all our operations comply with IATA and JIG (Joint Inspection Group) standards.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ct-accordion-item \">\r\n                    <div class=\"ct-ac-title \" data-target=\"#4f25348ct_accordion-6646056\">\r\n                        <a class=\"ct-ac-title-text\">Do you offer credit or fuel cards?                            <i class=\"ct-accordion-icon-plus\"><\/i>\r\n                        <\/a>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div id=\"4f25348ct_accordion-6646056\" class=\"ct-ac-content\">Yes, we offer credit terms and fuel cards for qualified operators. Contact our sales team for more information.<\/div>\r\n      